s fine but gives you `any`."],[9,"The Recall Reach public API SDK provides access to the Recall Reach public API REST APIs."],[24,"The rows /replay/{runId} shows. CPSC's public text and the demo shop's item titles, nothing about a buyer."],[19,"The same check as an MCP tool over Streamable HTTP"],[11,"The SDK compiles to `dist/` before it can be referenced, run its `build` script once in the SDK folder, then add it to your project by path:"],[18,"The server is stateless and opens no event stream, so a GET is refused with 405."],[20,"Two read-only tools: check_recall(title, model), and get_recall(recallNumber), which gives one recall's CPSC text. Stateless: each request stands alone. Send JSON-RPC 2.0, with Accept application/json, text/event-stream. It shares the limit of /api/check."],[3,"TypeScript SDK"],[29,"Whether the server answers. Touches no database."],[27,"Whether the site is working, check by check"],[26,"Works the counts out again from the run's stored rows and compares them with the numbers it reported."]],"type":"string"},"page_id":{"docs":{"1":16,"2":17,"3":18,"4":19,"5":20,"6":21,"7":22,"8":23,"9":24,"10":25,"11":26,"12":27,"13":28,"14":29,"15":0,"16":1,"17":4,"18":5,"19":2,"20":3,"21":6,"22":7,"23":8,"24":9,"25":10,"26":11,"27":12,"28":13,"29":14,"30":15},"orderedDocs":[[15,"/api/openapi/check/checkRecall"],[16,"/api/openapi/check/checkRecall"],[19,"/api/openapi/check/mcp"],[20,"/api/openapi/check/mcp"],[17,"/api/openapi/check/mcpNoStream"],[18,"/api/openapi/check/mcpNoStream"],[21,"/api/openapi/evidence/newestRecallDay"],[22,"/api/openapi/evidence/newestRecallDay"],[23,"/api/openapi/evidence/readReplay"],[24,"/api/openapi/evidence/readReplay"],[25,"/api/openapi/evidence/recountReplay"],[26,"/api/openapi/evidence/recountReplay"],[27,"/api/openapi/status/health"],[28,"/api/openapi/status/health"],[29,"/api/openapi/status/live"],[30,"/api/openapi/status/live"],[1,"/sdks"],[2,"/sdks"],[3,"/sdks/typescript"],[4,"/sdks/typescript"],[5,"/sdks/typescript"]